Lumen's workspace settings, one route per section: profile at `/settings/profile`, billing at `/settings/billing`, notifications at `/settings/notifications`, and a danger zone at `/settings/danger`, with a section navigation shared by all four (a side nav on desktop that becomes tabs or a menu on phones). Profile: name, email and avatar with inline validation and a Save button that is disabled until something changes. Billing: current plan (Team), seats used, next invoice date and amount, a payment method and an invoices table. Notifications: email and in-app toggles per event (mentions, assignments, weekly digest). Danger zone: transfer ownership, and "Delete workspace", which opens a confirmation dialog that asks the user to type the workspace name before the delete button is enabled. `/` redirects to `/settings/profile`.

